From: Nick Silvestro <nick@silvestron.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:12:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add the kernel32/user32 APIs the Xbox XDK 5849 toolchain
 needs

Adds lstrcmp/lstrcmpi (A and W), CopyFile, ExpandEnvironmentStrings, SearchPathA, OpenEventA, OpenFileMappingA, GetThreadLocale, LoadLibraryExA, FormatMessageW and user32 CharNextA. Link.Exe and Lib.Exe abort on the missing lstrcmpiA; the rest are imports of CL, C1xx and the mspdb DLLs.
